Simulator: Apple iPhone 16, iOS 26.5, UDID 46C711A9-E5FC-4147-82F2-7553D33E9B1B
           (`xcrun simctl create Corral528 "iPhone 16" com.apple.CoreSimulator.SimRuntime.iOS-26-5`)
Build:     Debug, /tmp/i528-dd (scheme FleetNotifier; the app the tests/gates built)
Driver:    one launch per matrix; `-corral528ConnectionEvidence` / `-corral528HerdEvidence`
           (+ `-corral528AccessibilitySizes -UIPreferredContentSizeCategoryName
           UICTContentSizeCategoryAccessibilityLarge` for the large-text pair)
Phases:    marker files written by the driver in Documents/ux-evidence AFTER each state
           settles; >= 9 s hold per phase; the host polls and screenshots each NEW
           marker >= 2 s after detection (capture always inside the phase it names).
Size:      `xcrun simctl io <udid> screenshot <raw>` (1179x2556 @3x) then
           `sips -z 844 390 <raw> --out <name>-390x844.png` (0.18 % aspect distortion).

